flowchart TD
    Start([User Submits Login Form]) --> RateCheck{Exceeded 10 req / 15m Rate Limit?}
    
    RateCheck -- Yes --> ErrRate[Return HTTP 429 RATE_LIMITED] --> EndFail([Login Terminated])
    
    RateCheck -- No --> LookupUser[Query User by Normalized Email]
    LookupUser --> FoundUser{User Record Exists?}
    
    FoundUser -- No --> AuditFail1[Record Audit LOGIN_FAILED]
    AuditFail1 --> ErrInvalid[Return HTTP 401 Invalid Credentials] --> EndFail
    
    FoundUser -- Yes --> CheckActive{Is isActive === true?}
    CheckActive -- No --> AuditFail2[Record Audit LOGIN_FAILED Deactivated]
    CheckActive -- No --> ErrDeactive[Return HTTP 403 Account Deactivated] --> EndFail
    
    CheckActive -- Yes --> ComparePwd[Verify Password with bcrypt]
    ComparePwd --> PwdMatch{Password Matches Hash?}
    
    PwdMatch -- No --> AuditFail3[Record Audit LOGIN_FAILED]
    AuditFail3 --> ErrInvalid
    
    PwdMatch -- Yes --> IssueJWT[Sign JWT Token with User ID & Role]
    IssueJWT --> UpdateLastLogin[Update user.lastLogin Timestamp]
    UpdateLastLogin --> AuditSuccess[Record Immutable Audit Event LOGIN]
    AuditSuccess --> ReturnSuccess[Return HTTP 200 with JWT & User Info]
    ReturnSuccess --> ClientStore[Client Stores JWT in localStorage]
    ClientStore --> RedirectRole[Redirect to Role-Aware Dashboard]
    RedirectRole --> EndSuccess([Session Authenticated])
